WEBVTT

00:03:29.247 --> 00:03:35.294
not just top governmental office,
but state and local offices

00:03:35.336 --> 00:03:37.505
which turn out to be really,
really important.

00:03:37.546 --> 00:03:41.092
You know, we have to break
the stranglehold

00:03:41.133 --> 00:03:43.844
that the fossil fuel industry
has on our government,

00:03:43.844 --> 00:03:45.763
not just here in North America,

00:03:45.763 --> 00:03:46.931
but globally.

00:03:46.973 --> 00:03:51.394
And that's why we're moving climate
activism into the electoral arena,

00:03:51.435 --> 00:03:55.690
which is kind of unique
because we focus down ballot

00:03:55.731 --> 00:04:00.152
and because we're trying to change
the narrative about fossil fuels.